### 🪄 Quick Recap:
| Operator | Meaning | Example | What it Does |
|-----------|----------|----------|----------------|
| `++n1` | Prefix increment | increases `n1` first | `n1 = 6 → 7` |
| `n1++` | Postfix increment | increases `n1` after | `n1 = 7 → 8` |
| `n1 + n2` | Binary addition | adds both objects | gives a new object |
| `n1 < n2` | Comparison | checks if smaller | returns `true` or `false` |

